  "name": "Kopi Tubruk",
  "price": "abc",
  "stock": 10
}

### C09 CREATE price float 10.5 -> 422 harus bilangan bulat
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Tubruk",
  "price": 10.5,
  "stock": 10
}

### C10 CREATE price negatif -> 422 tidak boleh negatif
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Tubruk",
  "price": -100,
  "stock": 10
}

